{"id":"n14906-1-5","stage":3,"title":"되돌리다 · 使掉头","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14906-1-5-1","ko":"시간이 너무 빨리 지나가. 벌써 다음 주면 시험이야.","zh":"时间过得也太快了。转眼间下周就要考试了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시간이","meaning":"光阴，时光","explanation":"시간：光阴，时光；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"5","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"지나가.","meaning":"经过，度过","explanation":"지나가다：经过，度过；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"지나가다","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60216","senseId":"3","lemma":"지나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지나가","audio":"/audio/f83a1e139a468c5b77b3.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],